   {
    "claim": "12855a41 at 0 s, 0.5x counts as a confirmed failure, but it may be a setup artifact. Front contact with lead car 5 came 0.5 s after handoff at about 3 m/s, with the ego on or near the recorded path. The triage marks every run 'unclear' and points to the replayed lead's box or timing. The +1 s shift did not fail.",
    "settings": [
