     "S25"
    ]
   },
   {
    "claim": "Triage shows front contact at the very instant of handoff, while the ego was still replaying the human drive, in all repeats of three settings. The table counts none of these as failures. The 0.5x lead then overlaps the recorded ego path, so the scenario itself is invalid there, and nearby timings on those scenes are suspect.",
    "settings": [
